{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1424862-\u00e6on-basic-aptitude-power-question","id":1424862,"title":"[\u00c6on] Basic Aptitude power question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-18T20:00:11-08:00","id":1424862,"title":"[\u00c6on] Basic Aptitude power question","content":"While Modes are stated as gaining an Enhancement when using powers of the Mode at a lower level than your current dot rating, what is the Enhancement bonus (if any) for using the basic powers of an Aptitude? <br /> Example for clarity: If I have 3 dots of Mindshare, using Network (1 dot of Mindshare) would net me a +2 Enhancement on that roll to activate, for example, and the 2 dot Mindshare power (can't recall) would net a +1 enhancement. What about the rolls of the basic powers? Would they get an Enhancement equal to my highest Mode? I know they roll a dice pool equal to Psi+highest Mode, so I would assume the Enhancement would be based similarly but wanted another opinion.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26269-bastion-avalos","name":"Bastion Avalos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-19T03:44:58-08:00","id":1424896,"title":"","content":"Basic powers count as 0-dot and characters get the usual Enhancement bonus. This means even a novice psion with only 1 dot in a single Mode will gain +1 Enhancement to the Basic Power activation.<br /> <br /> Remember that dice should only be rolled when it\u2019s interesting or risky, or the character failing would lead to drama. I\u2019d rarely call for anyone to have to roll to use their Basic powers unless under considerable duress - generally just allow automatic activation and give highest Mode dots successes if needed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-19T05:33:50-08:00","id":1424912,"title":"","content":"Interesting. I've been running them as &quot;non-dot&quot; powers. So, I haven't been granting any enhancement bonus. I don't think that would have changed my game any, but it's good to know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-19T07:54:16-08:00","id":1424937,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1424862-\u00e6on-basic-aptitude-power-question?p=1424912#post1424912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interesting. I've been running them as &quot;non-dot&quot; powers. So, I haven't been granting any enhancement bonus. I don't think that would have changed my game any, but it's good to know.</div> </div> </div> </div>As far as I remember, no Base power needs more than 2 successes to be full power. Maybe some can use a few more, but other than that is basically it, having 5 enhancements from a 5dot mode hardly have any use.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-19T08:18:21-08:00","id":1424938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1424862-\u00e6on-basic-aptitude-power-question?p=1424937#post1424937\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As far as I remember, no Base power needs more than 2 successes to be full power. Maybe some can use a few more, but other than that is basically it, having 5 enhancements from a 5dot mode hardly have any use.</div> </div> </div> </div>Burst under EK is probably the only one which springs to mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-19T10:28:40-08:00","id":1424970,"title":"","content":"Mindspeak for Telepathy let's you talk with other mind directly, and the more alien the more of a complication to overcome. Having the enhancement makes it much more likely to overcome barriers communicating even with alien species.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26269-bastion-avalos","name":"Bastion Avalos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-19T13:02:51-08:00","id":1424998,"title":"","content":"Mindspeak does rely on successes for understanding alien minds, but it\u2019s an unusual situation where it will be relevant as the Complication doesn\u2019t sidestep the other limitations on the power. That is, you still need a common language for anything beyond raw universal concepts (\u201cDanger\u201d, \u201cHungry\u201d, \u201cScared\u201d), and the subject has to be willing to allow the connection. So the level 4 Complication from the \u2018scared and unwilling Chromatic\u2019 doesn\u2019t happen unless that Chromatic has willingly accepted the connection (even though it\u2019s unwilling to \u2018speak\u2019) and you won\u2019t get more than basic concepts through the +4 Complication if it doesn\u2019t speak the same language as you. (And it\u2019s a Chromatic, it doesn\u2019t.)<br /> <br /> Mindspeak is good for talking silently with people you know, it\u2019s good for establishing a very basic connection with the unfamiliar, but it\u2019s not a universal translator communication device. You\u2019ll need Mindshare for that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-19T13:04:20-08:00","id":1424999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1424862-\u00e6on-basic-aptitude-power-question?p=1424912#post1424912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interesting. I've been running them as &quot;non-dot&quot; powers. So, I haven't been granting any enhancement bonus. I don't think that would have changed my game any, but it's good to know.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It wouldn\u2019t change much as most Basic powers are on/off without much interaction with successes. (Except Burst to an extent, and Mindspeak. Possibly a couple of others.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}